          "overview": "Hiding among the gangsters is like walking on thin ice—can the fiery youth hold onto their original aspirations and prove themselves? As the wheels of time roll on, the gangsters' rampant activities and \"spectacles\" have faded away. Today's peace and security are our best \"proof\".",
